        "state_and_cooking": "逐项按raw/cooked/ready_to_eat/ready_to_eat/ready_to_eat/cooked/raw/raw/ready_to_eat/ready_to_eat/ready_to_eat/ready_to_eat输入；成品covered_steaming。未把生料每100g当作成品值。",
